1
00:00:58,445 --> 00:01:00,489
Previously on Dating Alys Perez.

2
00:01:01,198 --> 00:01:03,409
Your mom says you're going on a vacation?

3
00:01:03,993 --> 00:01:04,952
Drake?!

4
00:01:04,952 --> 00:01:07,746
This place is a perfect place.

5
00:01:07,871 --> 00:01:10,165
To relax, enjoy...

6
00:01:10,165 --> 00:01:11,917
and be in love!

7
00:01:13,252 --> 00:01:14,920
With the nature, of course.

8
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:15,838
Would you

9
00:01:17,339 --> 00:01:19,633
treat me the same way you did before?

10
00:01:20,342 --> 00:01:21,135
Sure.

11
00:01:21,593 --> 00:01:22,511
Oh, geez!

12
00:01:24,722 --> 00:01:26,557
What are these for?

13
00:01:27,016 --> 00:01:28,600
This one is for your birthday.

14
00:01:28,809 --> 00:01:30,227
This one is for anniversary.

15
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:32,146
For monthsary.

16
00:01:32,855 --> 00:01:34,523
For saying thank you.

17
00:01:34,523 --> 00:01:36,150
For saying sorry.

18
00:01:36,150 --> 00:01:37,818
For saying i love you.

19
00:01:38,527 --> 00:01:39,903
I'm so happy

20
00:01:40,654 --> 00:01:43,198
that you are part of my life.

21
00:01:43,198 --> 00:01:44,658
Damn you, Palma.

22
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:50,330
Yeah.

23
00:01:50,831 --> 00:01:52,082
Damn me.

24
00:02:23,238 --> 00:02:24,448
Hello?

25
00:02:24,865 --> 00:02:26,075
I'm coming.

26
00:02:36,502 --> 00:02:37,586
Business partner.

27
00:02:37,836 --> 00:02:39,338
I need to go see him today.

28
00:02:40,047 --> 00:02:42,216
Oh. Really?

29
00:02:42,424 --> 00:02:43,111
Yes.

30
00:02:44,009 --> 00:02:46,303
I can't postpone this, Alys.

31
00:02:46,887 --> 00:02:47,814
Okay.

32
00:02:49,139 --> 00:02:50,557
Uh, Drake?

33
00:02:51,225 --> 00:02:52,017
Hmm?

34
00:02:53,102 --> 00:02:54,770
If I talk to Tripp,

35
00:02:55,854 --> 00:02:58,398
do you promise to
stay with me in this?

36
00:03:04,196 --> 00:03:05,739
I promise.

37
00:03:09,701 --> 00:03:10,661
Let's go?

38
00:03:11,578 --> 00:03:12,538
Let's go.

39
00:03:42,776 --> 00:03:44,653
<i>Breakfast in bed.</i>

40
00:03:45,195 --> 00:03:48,198
Wow, what are we?
Newly weds?

41
00:03:48,615 --> 00:03:49,950
It's just practice.

42
00:03:51,618 --> 00:03:52,536
Confident.

43
00:03:52,536 --> 00:03:53,453
Of course.

44
00:03:56,874 --> 00:03:58,542
<i>What's all this?</i>

45
00:03:58,542 --> 00:03:59,459
<i>Food.</i>

46
00:03:59,459 --> 00:04:01,879
But why is there so much?

47
00:04:02,546 --> 00:04:03,714
Alys,

48
00:04:04,173 --> 00:04:06,466
I'm not letting you go hungry.

49
00:04:12,014 --> 00:04:13,140
- What?
- Oh god!

50
00:04:14,516 --> 00:04:15,425
Oh my god!

51
00:04:16,935 --> 00:04:18,308
Don't startle me, Alys!

52
00:04:19,229 --> 00:04:20,272
<i>That's all for you.</i>

53
00:04:20,772 --> 00:04:22,232
<i>Are you kidding me?</i>

54
00:04:23,817 --> 00:04:25,277
I never cheated on you.

55
00:04:34,161 --> 00:04:35,120
Damn.

56
00:04:35,996 --> 00:04:37,706
All the memories in this room.

57
00:04:52,095 --> 00:04:52,846
Let's go?

58
00:04:54,056 --> 00:04:55,224
Let’s go.

59
00:05:22,251 --> 00:05:23,001
Alys,

60
00:05:23,377 --> 00:05:24,670
are you dating my cousin?

61
00:05:26,922 --> 00:05:27,798
Hey, Silly!

62
00:05:28,257 --> 00:05:29,216
You and Tripp...

63
00:05:29,383 --> 00:05:31,385
You love me too much, right?

64
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:32,844
More than too much.

65
00:05:33,220 --> 00:05:34,221
...good together.

66
00:05:35,681 --> 00:05:36,431
But Bestie,

67
00:05:36,431 --> 00:05:37,683
you and Drake,

68
00:05:37,891 --> 00:05:39,851
epic together!

69
00:05:40,185 --> 00:05:42,229
I know you still love Drake.

70
00:05:44,231 --> 00:05:47,150
Do you know how I cried when I
found out about you and Tripp?

71
00:05:47,401 --> 00:05:50,112
So, are you leaving Tripp for Drake?

72
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,947
There’s only one thing I ask of you.

73
00:05:53,031 --> 00:05:54,992
Love me a little more.

74
00:05:55,701 --> 00:05:57,828
The moment Drake comes back,

75
00:05:58,287 --> 00:05:59,705
you'll throw me away!

76
00:06:00,163 --> 00:06:01,665
I chose you.

77
00:06:02,207 --> 00:06:03,458
You chose me?

78
00:06:03,875 --> 00:06:05,252
It was Drake,

79
00:06:05,252 --> 00:06:06,628
and it always will be.

80
00:06:08,255 --> 00:06:09,631
<i>Please let me live my life.</i>

81
00:06:10,841 --> 00:06:11,842
All I want

82
00:06:12,926 --> 00:06:14,011
is a life without you.

83
00:06:16,221 --> 00:06:18,849
A life that isn’t focused around you.

84
00:06:19,141 --> 00:06:21,226
<i>You never loved me the</i>
<i>way I wanted you, Perez.</i>

85
00:06:22,019 --> 00:06:24,104
<i>I have to talk to Tripp.</i>

86
00:06:25,063 --> 00:06:27,941
<i>I need to tell him that </i>
<i>Drake and I are back together.</i>

87
00:06:28,859 --> 00:06:30,360
Don't worry.

88
00:06:31,695 --> 00:06:33,196
I promise you,

89
00:06:34,156 --> 00:06:35,615
go after Drake first.

90
00:06:37,367 --> 00:06:38,827
And if it doesn’t work out,

91
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,539
I'll come running back to you.

92
00:06:45,584 --> 00:06:46,460
Hello, Tripp?

93
00:06:47,586 --> 00:06:48,462
Zy?

94
00:06:50,672 --> 00:06:52,257
Can we talk?

95
00:06:53,175 --> 00:06:54,760
In person.

96
00:07:00,015 --> 00:07:00,807
When?

97
00:07:03,101 --> 00:07:04,269
<i>This afternoon.</i>

98
00:07:04,644 --> 00:07:06,521
<i>Around 5pm.</i>

99
00:07:11,026 --> 00:07:11,777
Alright.

100
00:07:14,946 --> 00:07:15,906
Thanks, Tripp.

101
00:07:16,573 --> 00:07:17,449
<i>Zy?</i>

102
00:07:17,991 --> 00:07:18,742
Hmm?

103
00:07:20,786 --> 00:07:22,245
Stand by your decision, okay?

104
00:07:24,164 --> 00:07:25,624
People are hurting already.

105
00:07:27,042 --> 00:07:28,251
<i>This is enough.</i>

106
00:07:29,086 --> 00:07:30,295
This is the last time.

107
00:07:30,962 --> 00:07:31,880
Yeah.

108
00:07:32,172 --> 00:07:33,382
I'm so sorry, Tripp.

109
00:07:34,549 --> 00:07:36,218
Apologize to me in person, Perez.

110
00:07:37,677 --> 00:07:39,346
<i>I think I deserve that.</i>

111
00:07:40,889 --> 00:07:41,848
I will.

112
00:07:42,724 --> 00:07:44,267
I'm so sorry.

113
00:07:44,810 --> 00:07:46,103
<i>See you later, Tripp.</i>

114
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,972
Oh? Where is he going?

115
00:11:09,806 --> 00:11:12,434
He’s going the wrong way.

116
00:12:23,046 --> 00:12:25,006
Huh? Hospital?

117
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:26,424
What’s happening?

118
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:27,842
There’s an emergency?

119
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:14,139
Room 320?

120
00:13:25,233 --> 00:13:26,526
What did you do, Drake?

121
00:13:27,861 --> 00:13:29,028
What did you do?!

122
00:13:29,279 --> 00:13:30,822
What did you do, Drake?!

123
00:13:32,407 --> 00:13:33,616
You’re crazy, Drake!

124
00:13:34,876 --> 00:13:37,003
Why did you do that?

125
00:13:38,830 --> 00:13:40,081
What have you done?

126
00:13:42,250 --> 00:13:43,752
You and Alys can’t be together anymore.

127
00:13:46,379 --> 00:13:47,505
How is she?

128
00:13:48,590 --> 00:13:49,549
Fier is pregnant.

129
00:13:52,010 --> 00:13:53,636
You can't be with Alys anymore.

130
00:14:13,573 --> 00:14:14,616
<i>Who are you?</i>

131
00:14:15,116 --> 00:14:15,867
Marie

132
00:14:16,493 --> 00:14:17,243
Fier

133
00:14:17,660 --> 00:14:18,578
Sandoval!

134
00:14:34,677 --> 00:14:35,845
<i>Who is Fier?</i>

135
00:14:37,138 --> 00:14:38,598
Don't be jealous.

136
00:14:40,475 --> 00:14:41,935
Don't worry about Fier.

137
00:14:42,936 --> 00:14:44,646
She's nothing compared to you.

138
00:14:50,235 --> 00:14:51,945
<i>I never cheated on you.</i>

139
00:14:55,490 --> 00:14:57,200
<i>I never cheated on you.</i>

140
00:15:01,079 --> 00:15:02,789
<i>I never cheated on you.</i>

141
00:15:26,563 --> 00:15:27,814
It can't be.

142
00:15:27,814 --> 00:15:29,566
It can’t be Drake’s, right?

143
00:15:32,402 --> 00:15:35,154
He couldn’t do that to me.

144
00:16:10,481 --> 00:16:12,817
Hello? Hello, Tripp?

145
00:16:13,234 --> 00:16:14,319
Zy?

146
00:16:15,486 --> 00:16:16,446
Where do we meet up?

147
00:16:16,738 --> 00:16:17,697
I'm almost ready.

148
00:16:18,072 --> 00:16:20,158
<i>Do I really want to drag him into this?</i>

149
00:16:21,451 --> 00:16:23,995
<i>Tripp had already been</i>
<i>through hell because of me.</i>

150
00:16:25,079 --> 00:16:28,082
<i>I don’t want to drag him </i>
<i>into my problems anymore.</i>

151
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:32,962
Zy?

152
00:16:33,963 --> 00:16:35,006
Are you crying?

153
00:16:37,175 --> 00:16:38,217
<i>Hello?</i>

154
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:40,303
<i>Are you still there?</i>

155
00:16:42,931 --> 00:16:43,973
Tripp...

156
00:16:45,558 --> 00:16:46,184
Hey.

157
00:16:47,101 --> 00:16:48,186
Why do you sound like that?

158
00:16:49,687 --> 00:16:50,521
I'm sorry.

159
00:16:50,521 --> 00:16:52,357
I’m not feeling well right now.

160
00:16:52,357 --> 00:16:54,359
<i>Can I meet you tomorrow instead?</i>

161
00:16:55,109 --> 00:16:55,985
I'm sorry.

162
00:16:56,235 --> 00:16:57,111
<i>What? But —</i>

163
00:17:33,439 --> 00:17:35,483
<i>Why is he here?</i>

164
00:17:35,483 --> 00:17:38,236
<i>Will he tell me the truth,</i>

165
00:17:38,236 --> 00:17:39,862
<i>or will he just lie to me?</i>

166
00:17:40,863 --> 00:17:42,198
<i>Either way,</i>

167
00:17:42,657 --> 00:17:43,825
<i>it’ll hurt just the same.</i>

168
00:17:47,704 --> 00:17:48,788
-Alys...
-What do you need?

169
00:17:48,788 --> 00:17:49,747
Alys?

170
00:17:49,747 --> 00:17:50,415
What?

171
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:52,125
I love you.

172
00:17:53,501 --> 00:17:55,336
Is he going to tell me that

173
00:17:55,336 --> 00:17:57,171
I love you but I can't marry you?

174
00:17:58,297 --> 00:18:00,258
Drake, do you want to
tell me something?

175
00:18:01,175 --> 00:18:02,552
Alys,

176
00:18:03,511 --> 00:18:05,388
I know you hate lies.

177
00:18:06,222 --> 00:18:08,057
And I don't like lying.

178
00:18:08,766 --> 00:18:10,059
I hate lies.

179
00:18:10,601 --> 00:18:11,894
I loathe them.

180
00:18:13,271 --> 00:18:14,772
Lies are destructive.

181
00:18:14,772 --> 00:18:16,899
Especially in relationships.
You know that, right?

182
00:18:22,196 --> 00:18:23,698
So, what is it?

183
00:18:25,783 --> 00:18:27,285
Alys...

184
00:18:28,286 --> 00:18:29,579
Fier is pregnant.

185
00:18:43,509 --> 00:18:45,053
Are you the father?

186
00:18:52,727 --> 00:18:54,395
Alys.

187
00:18:54,482 --> 00:18:56,564
Go away, Drake. Leave me alone!

188
00:18:56,564 --> 00:18:57,623
No, wait.

189
00:18:57,648 --> 00:18:58,983
- I said, leave!
- Alys!

190
00:18:58,983 --> 00:19:00,068
Don't you understand?

191
00:19:00,068 --> 00:19:01,986
Alys, you’re the one I love,
not Fier!

192
00:19:03,613 --> 00:19:05,198
You should’ve thought of that

193
00:19:05,198 --> 00:19:06,841
before you got her pregnant!

194
00:19:07,513 --> 00:19:09,265
It's already done, Alys.

195
00:19:10,078 --> 00:19:11,746
I can't escape from this.

196
00:19:12,371 --> 00:19:14,040
All I can do now,

197
00:19:15,416 --> 00:19:18,252
is be a good father to our child.

198
00:19:19,378 --> 00:19:20,379
But, Alys...

199
00:19:22,381 --> 00:19:23,466
you’re the only one I love.

200
00:19:24,717 --> 00:19:26,302
It’s always been you.

201
00:19:26,636 --> 00:19:28,471
You had her pregnant, Drake!

202
00:19:29,013 --> 00:19:31,599
Do you think I’d just let that slide?!

203
00:19:31,933 --> 00:19:34,769
Alys, I'd never ask you to do that.

204
00:19:35,061 --> 00:19:36,145
All I ask

205
00:19:36,646 --> 00:19:38,815
is that you stay with me.
Don't leave me.

206
00:19:38,815 --> 00:19:40,274
You got her pregnant, Drake!

207
00:19:40,274 --> 00:19:41,818
Damn, she was your first!

208
00:19:41,818 --> 00:19:43,277
Do you want to drive me insane?!

209
00:19:43,277 --> 00:19:45,029
- Huh?
- But you're the one I want, Alys.

210
00:19:45,530 --> 00:19:46,614
Only you.

211
00:19:47,115 --> 00:19:48,533
I'm serious, Drake!

212
00:19:49,492 --> 00:19:51,119
Don’t mess with me!

213
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:52,745
Alys, Fier was a mistake!

214
00:19:54,205 --> 00:19:56,666
I will always choose you.

215
00:19:58,334 --> 00:20:00,461
Get it together, Palma!

216
00:20:00,795 --> 00:20:03,756
I am this close to hitting you!

217
00:20:04,924 --> 00:20:06,759
My head hurts so much

218
00:20:06,884 --> 00:20:09,053
considering the fact that
you're becoming a father,

219
00:20:09,137 --> 00:20:11,556
and you have the nerve
to make a fool out of me.

220
00:20:12,306 --> 00:20:13,266
Alys,

221
00:20:13,641 --> 00:20:15,309
I'm not trying to fool you.

222
00:20:16,144 --> 00:20:18,980
I’ve wanted to marry you for a long time.

223
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:22,150
How are you so calm about this?!

224
00:20:22,775 --> 00:20:25,945
Can’t you panic at least a little?!

225
00:20:25,945 --> 00:20:28,281
Fuck, Drake.
You’re going to have a baby!

226
00:20:31,742 --> 00:20:34,579
Alys, I’m calm because
you haven’t run away from me yet.

227
00:20:37,206 --> 00:20:38,624
Try leaving me.

228
00:20:39,125 --> 00:20:41,794
You’ll see how panicked I’ll get.

229
00:20:42,587 --> 00:20:44,630
<i>God, how am I supposed to do this?</i>

230
00:20:44,839 --> 00:20:47,258
<i>I love Drake. I really do.</i>

231
00:20:47,675 --> 00:20:51,137
<i>I can accept that he has a child </i>
<i>with someone else. But…</i>

232
00:20:51,637 --> 00:20:56,100
<i>But I'm not sure if my conscience</i>
<i>can take ruining that child's life.</i>

233
00:21:22,668 --> 00:21:24,420
Hey! Are you okay?

234
00:21:32,962 --> 00:21:34,714
Just go see her already.

235
00:21:36,724 --> 00:21:37,767
Who?

236
00:21:39,313 --> 00:21:41,315
Don't act dense. You're like...

237
00:21:41,771 --> 00:21:42,813
Whatever.

238
00:21:43,776 --> 00:21:46,500
It’s obvious you can’t be still
because you’re worried.

239
00:21:48,861 --> 00:21:50,279
Worried?

240
00:21:50,279 --> 00:21:51,489
You're making things up.

241
00:21:51,489 --> 00:21:52,615
Worried about who?

242
00:21:53,074 --> 00:21:54,075
Come on, man.

243
00:21:54,617 --> 00:21:55,910
Deny all you want.

244
00:21:56,869 --> 00:21:58,621
We both know the truth.

245
00:21:59,455 --> 00:22:00,414
You can't fool me.

246
00:22:08,256 --> 00:22:09,966
She said she wasn't feeling well.

247
00:22:10,758 --> 00:22:11,926
She says she can’t do it today.

248
00:22:12,718 --> 00:22:13,886
She wants to meet me tomorrow instead.

249
00:22:14,178 --> 00:22:15,513
Well, there you go.

250
00:22:15,513 --> 00:22:16,931
It’s already set.

251
00:22:17,974 --> 00:22:20,518
But, of course, there's
nothing you can do about it.

252
00:22:21,352 --> 00:22:24,355
You need to give her
the space she needs, right?

253
00:22:26,607 --> 00:22:29,527
It’s not as easy as it sounds.

254
00:22:31,654 --> 00:22:32,613
You know,

255
00:22:32,947 --> 00:22:34,031
you're confusing me.

256
00:22:35,157 --> 00:22:37,076
You know what we should do?

257
00:22:37,576 --> 00:22:38,703
Let's go out!

258
00:22:39,161 --> 00:22:40,538
But you're paying, of course.

259
00:22:41,122 --> 00:22:44,959
I haven't been treated by
Marco Palma in a while.

260
00:22:47,503 --> 00:22:48,254
Stop it.

261
00:22:48,879 --> 00:22:49,964
I've got something else to do.

262
00:22:50,256 --> 00:22:51,424
Do whatever you want.

263
00:22:53,467 --> 00:22:54,468
There you go again.

264
00:22:54,719 --> 00:22:56,429
You keep yourself busy,

265
00:22:57,471 --> 00:22:58,681
because you’re not with Alys anymore.

266
00:22:59,223 --> 00:23:00,725
So you can forget about her.

267
00:23:03,853 --> 00:23:05,313
Whatever.

268
00:23:07,732 --> 00:23:10,818
You'll move on one day, Marco Palma.

269
00:23:17,033 --> 00:23:18,242
Alys.

270
00:23:20,036 --> 00:23:21,746
Drake, how could you do this?

271
00:23:23,039 --> 00:23:24,749
You're having a child with Fier.

272
00:23:25,416 --> 00:23:26,792
You should be with her.

273
00:23:30,546 --> 00:23:32,757
I don't want to marry her.

274
00:23:35,426 --> 00:23:37,136
I'm sure about that.

275
00:23:37,845 --> 00:23:41,660
I don't want to marry Fier
just because she's having my child.

276
00:23:45,353 --> 00:23:48,356
I want to marry the
person that I love.

277
00:23:49,857 --> 00:23:51,776
That is you, Alys.

278
00:23:56,030 --> 00:23:58,491
Drake, I love you too, but...

279
00:23:59,283 --> 00:24:01,118
I want to talk to Fier if I can.

280
00:24:01,532 --> 00:24:02,700
Alys, I'm telling you —

281
00:24:02,787 --> 00:24:04,080
Drake, please.

282
00:24:05,247 --> 00:24:08,084
I feel like I'll go crazy
if I don't talk to her.

283
00:24:08,084 --> 00:24:10,711
Alys, you’ll only drive yourself
crazier if you talk to her.

284
00:24:10,711 --> 00:24:12,129
So forget about it.

285
00:24:16,008 --> 00:24:17,927
Drake, please. Let me talk to Fier.

286
00:24:18,511 --> 00:24:19,902
I'm begging you.

287
00:24:21,639 --> 00:24:23,724
Okay. Tomorrow.

288
00:24:25,184 --> 00:24:27,895
<i>We still have each</i>
<i>other despite everything.</i>

289
00:24:28,482 --> 00:24:30,859
<i>We can get through this. I know it.</i>

290
00:24:31,809 --> 00:24:35,146
<i>This is just but a</i>
<i>little wave in our boat.</i>

291
00:24:35,694 --> 00:24:38,114
<i>It won't sink our ship down.</i>

292
00:24:39,448 --> 00:24:40,582
Go home.

293
00:24:41,826 --> 00:24:43,020
I'm going to rest.

294
00:24:44,703 --> 00:24:47,164
I won't go home until
I know you're okay.

295
00:24:48,124 --> 00:24:50,459
I'm okay. Now, go home.

296
00:24:51,168 --> 00:24:53,671
You're not okay. I know you.

297
00:24:55,589 --> 00:24:57,383
I'm okay. I promise.

298
00:24:58,300 --> 00:25:01,929
Drake, it’s not like the heaviness
I’m feeling will just go away.

299
00:25:03,722 --> 00:25:05,349
But I'll try.

300
00:25:07,017 --> 00:25:08,477
For the both of us.

301
00:25:11,772 --> 00:25:12,898
Go home.

302
00:25:21,753 --> 00:25:24,673
Drake! What a surprise!

303
00:25:24,705 --> 00:25:26,248
What are you doing here?

304
00:25:26,662 --> 00:25:28,205
I just came to see Alys.

305
00:25:28,372 --> 00:25:30,958
Perfect.
I just brought some food from Botejyu.

306
00:25:31,144 --> 00:25:33,561
I heard you love ramen.

307
00:25:33,586 --> 00:25:34,795
So, let's eat.

308
00:25:41,004 --> 00:25:43,971
I'm sorry, Mom.
But Drake was about to go home.

309
00:25:45,121 --> 00:25:47,516
Okay, maybe next time.

310
00:25:47,917 --> 00:25:49,336
Yes, Auntie.

311
00:25:49,852 --> 00:25:50,644
I'll go ahead.

312
00:25:50,644 --> 00:25:52,980
Uncle, Auntie. Alys.

313
00:25:56,692 --> 00:25:58,611
Alys...

314
00:25:58,736 --> 00:25:59,987
Are you getting back together?

315
00:26:00,446 --> 00:26:01,447
Mommy...

316
00:26:01,530 --> 00:26:02,865
Come on! Spill the tea.

317
00:26:05,409 --> 00:26:06,744
Mommy, please. Not right now.

318
00:26:06,952 --> 00:26:08,162
Maybe next time.

319
00:26:08,454 --> 00:26:09,914
Are you like that with your mom now?

320
00:26:09,914 --> 00:26:10,764
Hon...

321
00:26:10,789 --> 00:26:11,624
I know you're happy.

322
00:26:11,624 --> 00:26:13,501
Let's leave them be.

323
00:26:13,792 --> 00:26:15,085
Okay, fine.

324
00:26:15,085 --> 00:26:16,462
Aren’t you going to walk him out?

325
00:26:16,462 --> 00:26:18,964
I was supposed to but you stopped me.

326
00:26:18,964 --> 00:26:20,549
Okay. Go ahead.

327
00:26:22,043 --> 00:26:23,628
Let's eat.

328
00:26:24,678 --> 00:26:27,223
You go ahead.
I'll get something first.

329
00:26:30,059 --> 00:26:31,824
What happened here?

330
00:26:35,397 --> 00:26:36,707
Go home.

331
00:26:38,859 --> 00:26:40,528
What about your mom?

332
00:26:41,070 --> 00:26:42,121
This is better.

333
00:26:43,742 --> 00:26:46,244
It's best to keep things
between us for now.

334
00:26:47,040 --> 00:26:51,252
I don’t know how I’ll react
if the topic of Fier comes up again.

335
00:26:52,248 --> 00:26:54,458
There's too much
going on in my head and

336
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:57,711
honestly, there's no room
for anyone else's opinions.

337
00:26:58,045 --> 00:26:59,699
Is that okay with you?

338
00:27:01,966 --> 00:27:03,300
We'll talk tomorrow, Drake.

339
00:27:03,717 --> 00:27:04,843
Okay?

340
00:27:05,469 --> 00:27:06,720
Okay.

341
00:27:16,021 --> 00:27:16,939
Alys...

342
00:27:19,233 --> 00:27:20,901
Only you can make me marry you.

343
00:27:22,361 --> 00:27:24,113
1131.

344
00:27:24,113 --> 00:27:25,145
Always.

345
00:27:27,116 --> 00:27:29,827
You know me too well, Drake Palma.

346
00:28:03,068 --> 00:28:05,446
Shit!
I forgot to turn on my phone.

347
00:28:05,446 --> 00:28:08,449
My god.
I hope I didn't miss anything.

348
00:28:09,074 --> 00:28:13,537
<i>Hey, Perez!</i>
<i>Are we still going to meet today?</i>

349
00:28:15,122 --> 00:28:16,081
<i>Hello?</i>

350
00:28:17,107 --> 00:28:18,250
<i>Are you okay?</i>

351
00:28:19,671 --> 00:28:22,215
<i>Zyril, please answer!</i>

352
00:28:29,970 --> 00:28:33,682
<i>Need to reschedule.</i>
<i>Sorry. Will let you know when.</i>

353
00:28:40,105 --> 00:28:41,794
I'm so sorry, Tripp.

354
00:28:42,191 --> 00:28:45,694
I really can't risk talking
to you in my state like this.

355
00:28:46,362 --> 00:28:47,446
My head is all over the place.

356
00:28:47,446 --> 00:28:49,114
There’s just too much going on.

357
00:29:05,422 --> 00:29:09,051
You can do this, Alys.
Let's get this over and done with.

358
00:29:18,212 --> 00:29:21,173
<i>I feel like my chest is about to burst.</i>

359
00:29:22,189 --> 00:29:22,981
<i>I want to fight for this.</i>

360
00:29:22,981 --> 00:29:25,537
<i>But if Fier uses her baby against me,</i>

361
00:29:25,651 --> 00:29:28,487
<i>I might give up before</i>
<i>she finishes talking.</i>

362
00:29:30,030 --> 00:29:32,324
<i>She's having a baby with Drake.</i>

363
00:29:32,480 --> 00:29:34,232
<i>What chance do I have against that?</i>

364
00:29:39,248 --> 00:29:40,380
Noob.

365
00:29:42,040 --> 00:29:43,123
Look at me.

366
00:29:43,335 --> 00:29:44,044
Hmm?

367
00:29:44,044 --> 00:29:45,504
Now, look at you.

368
00:29:45,504 --> 00:29:47,339
Why aren't you nervous?

369
00:29:48,298 --> 00:29:50,801
Because I’m going to face this
with you by my side.

370
00:29:52,803 --> 00:29:53,971
Palma...

371
00:29:55,097 --> 00:29:56,724
Fier really is pregnant with your child.

372
00:29:56,724 --> 00:29:58,892
Otherwise, if this is
one of your tricks again,

373
00:29:58,892 --> 00:30:00,436
God knows what I'll do to you.

374
00:30:01,603 --> 00:30:03,647
<i>If this is one of his messed up tricks,</i>

375
00:30:04,064 --> 00:30:05,357
god, I'll kill him.

376
00:30:05,357 --> 00:30:06,650
Alys,

377
00:30:07,276 --> 00:30:09,927
I don’t want to risk
what we have now, okay?

378
00:30:12,740 --> 00:30:14,241
I was just thinking about this last night.

379
00:30:14,293 --> 00:30:16,712
We'd come here
to settle things but...

380
00:30:17,536 --> 00:30:19,037
It's harder than I thought.

381
00:30:19,246 --> 00:30:20,248
Alys...

382
00:30:21,848 --> 00:30:23,224
If this is hard for you,

383
00:30:23,917 --> 00:30:25,335
then you don't have to do this.

384
00:30:25,669 --> 00:30:27,296
But this is for the best, Drake.

385
00:30:27,296 --> 00:30:28,297
And you know it.

386
00:30:28,297 --> 00:30:29,965
So you really want to talk to her?

387
00:30:30,799 --> 00:30:32,468
I need to talk to Fier.

388
00:30:32,468 --> 00:30:33,766
For my sanity!

389
00:30:33,791 --> 00:30:35,710
After you talk to her,

390
00:30:36,013 --> 00:30:37,931
if you ask me again,

391
00:30:38,749 --> 00:30:40,668
I'll only have one answer.

392
00:30:41,399 --> 00:30:43,609
You're the one I want to marry, Alys.

393
00:30:46,064 --> 00:30:47,732
Okay, but not now.

394
00:30:49,735 --> 00:30:50,740
Let's go?

395
00:30:50,861 --> 00:30:51,912
Let’s go.

396
00:30:53,113 --> 00:30:54,083
Let’s go.

397
00:31:11,924 --> 00:31:12,896
Game?

398
00:31:13,759 --> 00:31:14,568
Game.

399
00:31:24,061 --> 00:31:24,853
Who are you?

400
00:31:27,898 --> 00:31:30,108
Don't be so nosy, Lourd.

401
00:31:30,192 --> 00:31:31,902
Leave us.

402
00:31:49,253 --> 00:31:50,170
What do you need?

403
00:31:54,383 --> 00:31:55,717
Fier, I just...

404
00:31:55,717 --> 00:31:57,094
I just wanna talk.

405
00:32:07,938 --> 00:32:09,231
What else do you want?

406
00:32:10,357 --> 00:32:11,149
Fier...

407
00:32:12,442 --> 00:32:14,778
Is Drake really the father of your child?

408
00:32:18,716 --> 00:32:21,076
It just seems so hard to believe.

409
00:32:23,954 --> 00:32:25,005
Honestly...

410
00:32:26,331 --> 00:32:28,750
I still don't wanna believe it.

411
00:32:34,798 --> 00:32:36,425
It's my body, Alys.

412
00:32:37,384 --> 00:32:38,719
Surely,

413
00:32:39,152 --> 00:32:41,487
I'd know who the
father of my child is.

414
00:32:41,763 --> 00:32:42,848
Right?

415
00:32:45,142 --> 00:32:46,351
And you?

416
00:32:46,476 --> 00:32:48,228
Hardcore loser.

417
00:32:48,228 --> 00:32:49,062
What are you doing here?

418
00:32:49,062 --> 00:32:50,564
Don't call me a loser.

419
00:32:53,025 --> 00:32:54,484
So what do you prefer?

420
00:32:54,735 --> 00:32:55,819
Douche?

421
00:32:57,029 --> 00:32:57,849
Jerk?

422
00:32:59,489 --> 00:33:00,490
No.

423
00:33:00,741 --> 00:33:02,075
I still prefer loser.

424
00:33:02,751 --> 00:33:03,835
It suits you.

425
00:33:04,536 --> 00:33:06,455
You freaking banged me

426
00:33:06,455 --> 00:33:09,124
and you’re going to tell me
you don’t want to take responsibility?

427
00:33:09,625 --> 00:33:10,542
Wait, what?

428
00:33:10,542 --> 00:33:12,586
My parents put me through school,

429
00:33:12,586 --> 00:33:14,630
not so you could get me pregnant
and then run away.

430
00:33:14,630 --> 00:33:16,214
To hell with you, Palma!

431
00:33:16,214 --> 00:33:17,799
Fier, I won’t run away from you.

432
00:33:17,824 --> 00:33:19,787
So walking out wasn't
considered running?

433
00:33:20,385 --> 00:33:22,679
You fucking moron!

434
00:33:29,561 --> 00:33:34,316
Drake, I'm not like what other
people might actually think.

435
00:33:34,608 --> 00:33:36,234
I'm educated.

436
00:33:37,937 --> 00:33:40,482
You don't get to treat me like trash.

437
00:33:41,365 --> 00:33:43,116
<i>This is what I’ve been thinking about.</i>

438
00:33:43,573 --> 00:33:45,324
<i>I was afraid this would happen.</i>

439
00:33:46,078 --> 00:33:48,205
<i>I'm also a woman.</i>

440
00:33:49,331 --> 00:33:52,125
<i>I know how hard it is for Fier.</i>

441
00:33:52,983 --> 00:33:57,112
<i>I couldn't even begin to imagine</i>
<i>what I'd do if I were in her place.</i>

442
00:33:57,355 --> 00:34:01,609
<i>Begging someone to marry you wasn't exactly</i>
<i>something anyone would want to do.</i>

443
00:34:02,260 --> 00:34:04,179
<i>It's pathetic and degrading.</i>

444
00:34:05,639 --> 00:34:07,557
I only begged once.

445
00:34:08,767 --> 00:34:10,060
And you rejected me.

446
00:34:11,520 --> 00:34:12,813
Who do you think you are?

447
00:34:14,064 --> 00:34:16,066
Who are you for me to beg?

448
00:34:17,109 --> 00:34:19,111
You're just some guy I slept with.

449
00:34:20,185 --> 00:34:21,341
Unfortunately,

450
00:34:21,905 --> 00:34:23,657
you gave me a souvenir.

451
00:34:23,949 --> 00:34:27,035
<i>I can't take what I'm hearing </i>
<i>from them anymore.</i>

452
00:34:27,035 --> 00:34:29,871
<i>It’s too much to hear,</i>
<i>much more to handle.</i>

453
00:34:29,871 --> 00:34:30,956
I’ll need to leave.

454
00:34:31,206 --> 00:34:32,165
No!

455
00:34:32,708 --> 00:34:34,084
You listen, Alys!

456
00:34:34,334 --> 00:34:35,961
I'm gonna have this child.

457
00:34:35,961 --> 00:34:37,713
And you're gonna have to suck it up!

458
00:34:39,339 --> 00:34:41,258
I was Drake's first.

459
00:34:41,717 --> 00:34:43,635
And I'm the mother of his child.

460
00:34:43,844 --> 00:34:44,928
Marry him.

461
00:34:46,221 --> 00:34:47,764
Get his fucking last name.

462
00:34:48,325 --> 00:34:50,661
But you can’t take away what I have.

463
00:34:51,935 --> 00:34:54,938
You will never outwin me, Perez.

464
00:34:55,772 --> 00:34:57,232
Remember that!

465
00:35:39,941 --> 00:35:41,777
Don't think about it.

466
00:35:43,487 --> 00:35:45,906
Easier said than done, Drake.

467
00:35:49,242 --> 00:35:53,371
It’s hard not to be affected
by the things I’ve heard.

468
00:35:56,166 --> 00:35:57,834
You can say all you want.

469
00:35:57,834 --> 00:36:00,670
Not to think about it or
let it get to me.

470
00:36:01,129 --> 00:36:03,048
But deep down, I know.

471
00:36:03,632 --> 00:36:05,801
That Fier is telling the truth.

472
00:36:06,176 --> 00:36:08,011
She has something I will never have.

473
00:36:08,678 --> 00:36:09,930
I told you.

474
00:36:10,597 --> 00:36:14,434
There’s no good outcome
from talking to her.

475
00:36:15,602 --> 00:36:19,439
What do you want me to do?
Act blind or deaf?

476
00:36:19,898 --> 00:36:22,359
If I didn't talk to her,

477
00:36:22,359 --> 00:36:24,903
it would be on my conscience all my life.

478
00:36:25,946 --> 00:36:28,490
Do you have any better ideas, Drake?

479
00:36:29,324 --> 00:36:30,700
I don't know.

480
00:36:31,827 --> 00:36:35,372
All I know is I don't want
you to stress over this, Alys.

481
00:36:35,956 --> 00:36:38,667
How could I not be stressed, Drake?

482
00:36:41,378 --> 00:36:44,965
My boyfriend is having a
baby with somebody else.

483
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:49,136
And she wants you to stay with her.

484
00:36:50,720 --> 00:36:52,430
If that's not problematic enough,

485
00:36:52,430 --> 00:36:55,225
maybe I have no idea
what a real problem is.

486
00:36:57,894 --> 00:36:59,980
I can't take this, Drake.

487
00:37:00,814 --> 00:37:03,483
And I don't want to lie to you, Drake.

488
00:37:04,526 --> 00:37:07,571
I know this problem will only get harder,

489
00:37:07,571 --> 00:37:10,073
and it will be impossible to resolve

490
00:37:10,073 --> 00:37:12,868
and there's just way
too many people involved.

491
00:37:14,286 --> 00:37:15,829
Just stop.

492
00:37:20,083 --> 00:37:21,084
How?

493
00:37:25,630 --> 00:37:30,385
I love you enough to know that
we'll get through everything, Alys.

494
00:37:35,807 --> 00:37:38,643
You always know exactly what to say.

495
00:37:40,020 --> 00:37:42,314
Just don't leave me, Alys.

496
00:37:43,356 --> 00:37:45,901
I won't leave you, Drake.
I'm not running away.

497
00:37:45,901 --> 00:37:48,028
Why do you always
think that I'll leave you?

498
00:37:48,179 --> 00:37:49,263
I don’t know.

499
00:37:49,597 --> 00:37:51,557
I guess I’m just being paranoid.

500
00:37:53,187 --> 00:37:54,313
Why?

501
00:37:55,171 --> 00:37:57,173
Because I love you so much, Alys.

502
00:38:02,500 --> 00:38:04,586
And think this isn’t healthy anymore.

503
00:38:04,611 --> 00:38:06,697
And I don't even know what
I can do about it.

504
00:38:08,796 --> 00:38:10,840
But I love you so much, Alys.

505
00:38:11,888 --> 00:38:14,682
The mere thought that
you'd leave me again,

506
00:38:15,380 --> 00:38:17,257
it’s already killing me.

507
00:38:22,562 --> 00:38:23,605
Drake,

508
00:38:24,898 --> 00:38:25,941
look at me.

509
00:38:30,799 --> 00:38:32,342
I'm not leaving you.

510
00:38:38,310 --> 00:38:41,438
I won't go away.
So don't be scared.

511
00:38:41,539 --> 00:38:42,480
Okay?

512
00:38:42,832 --> 00:38:44,084
I hope so.

513
00:38:44,668 --> 00:38:45,480
Okay.

514
00:38:45,669 --> 00:38:46,691
I’m going.

515
00:38:52,035 --> 00:38:54,177
The thought of forgetting you, Alys,

516
00:38:54,177 --> 00:38:56,513
is already driving me insane.

517
00:38:57,853 --> 00:38:59,688
Can you feel that?

518
00:39:00,571 --> 00:39:03,657
That's the heart of a man
who is obsessed with you.

519
00:39:05,397 --> 00:39:08,027
You always call me selfish.

520
00:39:10,026 --> 00:39:11,987
But Alys, is that really selfish?

521
00:39:12,455 --> 00:39:14,749
To put your well being first

522
00:39:14,774 --> 00:39:16,818
before my own feelings?

523
00:39:17,977 --> 00:39:19,603
I'm still in love with you, Alys.

524
00:39:21,746 --> 00:39:22,723
Always.

525
00:39:24,416 --> 00:39:25,250
Always.

526
00:39:26,418 --> 00:39:29,629
Marry me or lose me forever.

527
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:39,548
Drake, will you marry me?

528
00:39:41,141 --> 00:39:44,227
I know this is the worst plan of them all.

529
00:39:44,519 --> 00:39:45,603
But...

530
00:39:46,021 --> 00:39:48,481
I've always wanted to marry you, Drake.

531
00:39:49,316 --> 00:39:53,153
And I know this is nowhere
near the perfect timing but...

532
00:39:57,699 --> 00:39:59,534
I just can't help myself.

533
00:39:59,690 --> 00:40:01,942
My heart keeps on telling me this.

534
00:40:02,646 --> 00:40:04,899
Drake Sebastian Jimenez Palma...

535
00:40:06,207 --> 00:40:10,420
I know I rejected you to the
point that I've lost count already.

536
00:40:11,046 --> 00:40:12,672
And I know this is the wrong decision.

537
00:40:12,672 --> 00:40:15,258
Considering the fact that you're
having a child and...

538
00:40:15,717 --> 00:40:17,969
I know it's unfair for the baby.

539
00:40:18,261 --> 00:40:19,971
And for Fier, but...

540
00:40:21,931 --> 00:40:24,351
I love you so much, Drake.
And...

541
00:40:24,726 --> 00:40:25,602
I know myself.

542
00:40:25,602 --> 00:40:26,603
I know that

543
00:40:26,603 --> 00:40:29,314
when all of this gets
too much to bear for me,

544
00:40:29,314 --> 00:40:30,565
I'm gonna give up.

545
00:40:31,483 --> 00:40:33,068
I don't want to give up on you, Drake.

546
00:40:33,068 --> 00:40:35,862
I don't want —
I don't want to give you up again.

547
00:40:36,754 --> 00:40:39,491
Fuck, I gave you up way too many times.

548
00:40:40,059 --> 00:40:41,268
So please,

549
00:40:41,810 --> 00:40:45,022
just this once,
can I please be selfish?

550
00:40:46,010 --> 00:40:49,888
Will you please marry
this selfish girl, Drake?

551
00:40:51,336 --> 00:40:53,713
Drake, you're scaring me!

552
00:40:55,264 --> 00:40:56,223
Drake!

553
00:40:57,258 --> 00:40:59,511
Don't you want to marry me?

554
00:41:00,908 --> 00:41:03,493
Are you marrying Fier
because of the baby?

555
00:41:04,808 --> 00:41:07,060
If that's the case, please tell me.

556
00:41:07,435 --> 00:41:08,353
Please.

557
00:41:09,104 --> 00:41:10,146
Please.

558
00:41:11,689 --> 00:41:13,566
Say something, anything!

559
00:41:15,902 --> 00:41:17,278
Please!

560
00:41:18,113 --> 00:41:19,697
Say anything!

561
00:41:19,697 --> 00:41:20,573
Please!

562
00:41:23,592 --> 00:41:25,594
Are you going crazy, Alys?

563
00:41:26,996 --> 00:41:28,998
I will marry you in a heartbeat.

564
00:41:29,916 --> 00:41:32,877
Wherever, whenever.

565
00:41:33,359 --> 00:41:35,069
Why aren’t you answering me?!

566
00:41:35,094 --> 00:41:37,221
Are you trying to
make me worry to death?

567
00:41:37,298 --> 00:41:39,843
I can't even feel my face.

568
00:41:50,145 --> 00:41:51,479
Damn, Perez.

569
00:41:52,355 --> 00:41:55,275
I love you so much.

570
00:42:11,291 --> 00:42:12,375
Mom...

571
00:42:13,918 --> 00:42:15,295
Mom, Dad,

572
00:42:16,095 --> 00:42:17,430
I have something to say.

573
00:42:20,133 --> 00:42:21,468
Drake and I...

574
00:42:24,888 --> 00:42:26,222
We're getting married.

575
00:42:32,562 --> 00:42:34,355
I'm sorry, Alys. But you can't.

576
00:43:04,511 --> 00:43:05,637
<i>Drake,</i>

577
00:43:05,637 --> 00:43:07,764
<i>we're at the hospital.</i>

578
00:43:07,764 --> 00:43:09,307
<i>Please come.</i>

579
00:43:09,307 --> 00:43:10,683
<i>Fier needs you.</i>

580
00:43:11,197 --> 00:43:12,574
Hello, Tripp?

581
00:43:22,567 --> 00:43:24,945
<i>Why do I feel that</i>
<i>something is wrong?</i>

582
00:43:28,117 --> 00:43:31,079
<i>I feel like something bad</i>
<i>is gonna happen.</i>

583
00:43:34,332 --> 00:43:35,458
<i>Please. </i>

584
00:43:35,742 --> 00:43:37,160
<i>I hope it's nothing.</i>

585
00:43:39,796 --> 00:43:42,715
<i>No, I'm just overthinking.</i>

586
00:43:54,542 --> 00:43:56,252
<i>I just got her back.</i>

587
00:44:00,989 --> 00:44:03,074
<i>I don't want to lose her again.</i>

588
00:44:41,569 --> 00:44:45,239
On the next episode of
Dating Alys Perez.

589
00:44:45,403 --> 00:44:46,446
Come on, Mom!

590
00:44:46,446 --> 00:44:49,032
Dad accepted you even when
you had a child that wasn't his.

591
00:44:49,032 --> 00:44:49,995
Why —

592
00:44:50,632 --> 00:44:52,717
Alys, I'm sorry.

593
00:44:53,995 --> 00:44:55,079
Tripp...

594
00:44:55,079 --> 00:44:56,497
I'll go to you.

595
00:44:57,081 --> 00:44:59,542
I promised I'd never leave you, right?

596
00:44:59,751 --> 00:45:00,710
Shut up, Fier!

597
00:45:01,101 --> 00:45:03,562
I didn't raise you just to
be pregnant and unwed!

598
00:45:03,616 --> 00:45:04,409
But Dad...

599
00:45:04,672 --> 00:45:06,549
Maybe that’s just how it is.

600
00:45:07,050 --> 00:45:10,762
Some dreams change as we grow older.

601
00:45:11,127 --> 00:45:12,503
Some are replaced.

602
00:45:12,930 --> 00:45:15,183
There’s only thing that hasn’t
been replaced.

603
00:45:15,399 --> 00:45:16,609
What?

604
00:45:16,976 --> 00:45:18,686
I think the question should be...

605
00:45:19,206 --> 00:45:20,161
Who?

606
00:45:20,271 --> 00:45:23,274
Actually, I don’t know if
any of this is right anymore.

607
00:45:24,328 --> 00:45:25,996
I also don’t know, Alys.

608
00:45:26,486 --> 00:45:28,692
All I know is that I love you so much.
